Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 02:33:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: fill required Responses ids for Grok CLI serde

Idle abort still failed with missing field id because CLI requires
id on the event and on item/error objects, not only response.id.
Rewrite streamed Responses events to supply missing response/item
ids and emit a complete incomplete trailer.
